  "description": "1000W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi Wombat-1 features a powerful 1000W motor producing up to 75Nm of torque, allowing rapid acceleration from 4.9″ to 46 km/h. This high-performance motor delivers efficient power and easily manages heavy loads.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi Wombat-1 is powered by a 48V 20Ah Samsung battery using 21700 cells, delivering higher capacity in a compact, lightweight design. It can travel up to 60 km in full electric mode and 150 km with pedal assist, making it perfect for urban cargo transport and daily deliveries.\n\nFork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi Wombat-1 is equipped with dual oil-spring lockable forks and 20×3.0” tires that absorb shocks from rough terrain, providing a smooth and comfortable riding experience.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
